  "details": "it seams that the expression menu text is not rendered if the avatar is scaled down in unity, the smaller the avatar is, the smaller the menu is and at some point the engine thinks it does not have enough room to display the text. \nas for exemple  I am using a scaled down avatar to look like a small cat.  my scaling is about 0.278 (yes really small ) \nI am about 20cm in virtual. but it seams like the  ui could still display text but it does not, making navigation the menu a chore if you didn't made any icons for it yet",
